{
  "name": "Create and publish YouTube Shorts from Google Sheets topics with OpenAI and Treza",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3920bfbd-8717-543d-92e8-ec70fbb48345",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 1100,
        "content": "## From a topic in a sheet to a Short on YouTube\nAdd a topic to a Google Sheet. An AI model writes the shot, a title and a caption, Treza renders a 9:16 clip, and it is uploaded to YouTube. The row is updated at every stage and your team gets a Slack message.\n\n### How it works\n1. **New topic in sheet** picks up added rows, and **Has a topic?** skips blank ones.\n2. **Mark as rendering** sets its `status`.\n3. **Write the shot and caption** turns the topic into a shot, a title and a caption, in your voice.\n4. **Generate the video** gets a quote from Treza, stops if it is over **Max Cost**, and renders. **Wait for the render** covers long renders.\n5. **Did it render?** sends a finished clip to **Upload to YouTube**, and a failed one to **Mark as failed**.\n6. **Write the links back** fills in the row, then **Tell the team in Slack** posts the link.\n\n### Setup\n1. Make a sheet with the columns `topic`, `status`, `title`, `caption`, `video_url` and `youtube_url`.\n2. Pick that sheet in the three Google Sheets nodes.\n3. Add your OpenAI, Treza, Google Sheets, YouTube and Slack credentials, and pick the Slack channel.\n4. Activate the workflow and add a row with a topic.\n\n### Customization\nVideos upload as **private** for review. Set `privacy` in **Settings** to `public` to post straight away. Edit `voice` to match your channel.\n\n### Requirements\n- The verified community node **Treza** (`@treza/n8n-nodes-treza`, tested with 0.1.3 on n8n 2.46.6). On n8n Cloud, search for Treza in the nodes panel. Self-hosted: Settings > Community Nodes. Guide: https://www.trezalabs.com/integrations/n8n\n- A Treza API key from https://www.trezalabs.com/platform/api-keys with the pipelines:read, pipelines:write and pipelines:run permissions, saved as a **Treza API** credential.\n- OpenAI, Google Sheets, YouTube and Slack credentials."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7e1434f8-2a46-51c7-b1d6-6a46ce6b4fa7",
      "name": "Note: plan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 880,
        "height": 660,
        "content": "## 1. Pick up new topics\nRows with a `topic` go on and are marked as rendering. **Settings** holds the shape, length, spend cap, voice and privacy.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1619470f-64b9-534b-a5ec-d6bc8f7784bf",
      "name": "Note: write",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 400,
        "height": 660,
        "content": "## 2. Write it\nThe chat model turns the topic into a shot description for the video model, plus a title and a caption.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ee17081e-25a6-5bc9-9aff-e98381d074dd",
      "name": "Note: render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1280,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 660,
        "content": "## 3. Render\nTreza quotes the clip first and stops, with nothing charged, if it costs more than Max Cost. Long renders are waited on.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d0c6daa2-9581-5095-81ec-2cf8e1818ca3",
      "name": "Note: publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 940,
        "height": 660,
        "content": "## 4. Publish and report\nA finished clip is uploaded to YouTube, the row gets its links, and Slack is told. A failed render is marked on the row.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
